# Moi file .sh PHAI luu bang LF trong repo, du may lam viec la Windows va
# core.autocrlf dang bat. Neu mot script bi commit lai voi CRLF thi tren Linux
# (Codespaces, container, VPS) bash se doc ky tu \r nhu mot phan cua lenh va bao
# `$'\r': command not found` — loi rat kho doan vi noi dung file nhin van dung.
# Cung ho voi bay chmod +x: script viet o Windows, chay o Linux.
*.sh text eol=lf

# Cung ly do: file trong .devcontainer va cac file cau hinh se duoc doc boi
# cong cu chay tren Linux.
.devcontainer/** text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
